sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    actor F as Freelancer
    participant API as Backend
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant CR as Hourly scheduler
    C->>API: Accept proposal (milestone 1 = Rs. X)
    API->>DB: Wallet covers X? (check before any write)
    API->>DB: Create contract and milestones
    API->>DB: Atomic debit of wallet, Payment deposit_paid
    API-->>F: Notify: hired, escrow funded
    F->>API: Submit delivery
    API->>DB: Milestone must be funded or in_revision
    API->>DB: Status submitted, reviewDeadline = now + 7 days
    alt Client approves in time
        C->>API: Approve delivery
    else Review window lapses
        CR->>API: Auto-release overdue milestones
    end
    API->>DB: Claim the Payment (deposit_paid to released)
    API->>DB: Fee deducted, freelancer wallet credited
    API->>DB: Milestone released, contract advances or completes
    API-->>F: Notify: payment released
    opt More milestones remain
        C->>API: Fund milestone 2 (previous must be released)
    end
